# Clear messages when the server says no (specs/002-manage-server-files US7): a full account is found out before any byte is sent and said so, a locked
# file is refused with its own message and not retried by itself, and both stay in the queue with their reason. Run after 08-delete.walk.
# server quota 1
# server lock /Documents/notes.txt
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeFiles
waitfor folderRow
# an upload into an account with no room left
tap folderAdd
wait 500
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerTile 0
wait 700
tap pickerTile 5
expect pickerSelection 1 file(s)
tap pickerUpload
waitfor dialogText in the queue
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
tap folderSelect
wait 400
tap folderRow 3
tap folderDelete
waitfor folderDeleteConfirm
tap footerButton 1
waitfor dialogText in the queue
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
tap folderQueue
waitfor queueRow
tap queueSend
waitfor queueRowCaption Failed
wait 1000
shot @OUT@/90-queue-refusals.png
expect queueRowCaption storage
# the failed items stay in the queue, and a second Send does not try them again by itself
tap queueSend
wait 1500
shot @OUT@/91-queue-still-failed.png
